<title>UK: CLF Hypo sets 200 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypo sets 200 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY   *19.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    19.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    BERLIN    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 19.DEC.97 THEN STEPS-UP TO 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		 IF NOT CALLED AT PAR.</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	OFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 575</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
